    "quer3q/kraken-mount": {
      "444099863": {
        "body": "kraken mount v0.0.1-beta first public build. kraken mount is experimental: expect rough edges, and keep a copy of any game you can t easily get back it registers games from debug fpkg .pkg files and game folders plain, zstd or lz4 packs without installing them, and runs them through ampr-emu-ng ampr-emu-ng v0.4.0 is bundled and installed into data krakenmount ampr on first start fpkg .pkg games are the newest and least tested part. a game can run worse as a .pkg than the same game in zstd packs; if one stutters or fails, try it as a zstd folder only a small number of games have been tried so far. settings, cache layout and paths may still change between releases, which can mean a cache rebuild if a game fails to show up, register or launch, open an issue with the game, its source type pkg or folder and the lines from data krakenmount kraken.log",
